{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_bwvpI8RIigkO4yZQIEwgYVX8","content":"1\t# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n2\t\n3\tA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\n4\tscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n5\t~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\n6\tvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n7\t\n8\tLayout, relative to my home:\n9\t\n10\t- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n11\t  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n12\t- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n13\t- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n14\t- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n15\t- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n16\t\n17\tI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\n18\tfailure notes."}
